BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Connect U
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260902T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260902T170000
UID:connect-u-1@ocadu.ca
DESCRIPTION:Connect U - Fall 2026 Orientation\n\nFeeling a bit out of plac
 e? You’re not alone. Starting university can be a rollercoaster — new 
 people\, new routines\, maybe a new city or country. Whether you're from d
 own the street or across the globe\, adjusting to campus life can feel lik
 e stepping into a whole new world. Join fellow first-year students and som
 e awesome upper-year mentors for a fun\, eye-opening session led by a skil
 led community builder. Through games\, conversation\, and unexpected twist
 s\, you’ll explore how culture shapes the way we see\, speak\, and conne
 ct — and leave with fresh insight into yourself and the people around yo
 u. Come curious. Leave connected. We’ll wrap up the afternoon with a piz
 za lunch and an optional tour of the campus (tour begins at 4 p.m.) As we 
 have limited space\, please RSVP to attend Are you new to OCAD U and looki
 ng to join our peer mentor program as a student mentee? Sign up here ! We 
 will match you to an upper-year student Peer Mentor\, who will support you
  in settling into life at OCAD U. Presented by Campus Life
LOCATION:Learning Zone 113 McCaul Street Level 1 of the Annex Building\, 1
 13 McCaul St. near the St. Patrick St. entrance.
URL:https://www.ocadu.ca/events-and-exhibitions/connect-u-1
X-SOURCE:OCAD University
END:VEVENT
