BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Call for Submissions: Face2Face 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260830T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260830T235959
UID:call-submissions-face2face-2026@ocadu.ca
DESCRIPTION:Virtual Exhibition 2026\n\nNew or first-year? Have you accepte
 d your offer to study at OCAD University\, starting in September 2026? Con
 grats and welcome to OCAD U! Participate in our unique orientation and wel
 come tradition\, " face2face: virtual exhibition " and introduce yourself 
 to our community! Show us who you are and let's meet face-2-face! Submit a
  self-portrait for a chance to win a prize courtesy of Above Ground Art Su
 pplies ! You can see current (and past) submissions here! How? Send us an 
 existing self-portrait or create a new one! Draw\, paint\, collage\, photo
 graphy\, video\, animation... or other! Photograph or scan your work... or
  create it digitally! Make it a literal likeness or a metaphorical represe
 ntation! Have fun! Play around with the idea of your self-image. Express y
 our own unique style. How would you like to be seen? Be modest\, outrageou
 s\, fanciful\, or elegant! FORMAT/SIZING Digital Self-portraits: Landscape
 : 1080 x 608 pixels Square: 1080 x 1080 pixels Portrait: 1080 x 1350 pixel
 s Resolution: 72 dpi Format: png or jpg Animation or video: Instagram supp
 orts an aspect ratio of 1.91: 1 to 4:5 for all feed videos Your video or a
 nimation can be no less than 3 seconds and no more than 60 second Note: Do
  not use copyright-protected images/graphics or music! If you are keen to 
 use AI\, we encourage its use as a thoughtful\, supportive tool rather tha
 n the sole method for creating your self-portrait\, ensuring the final wor
 k reflects your own ideas\, decisions\, and creative input in line with OC
 AD University’s guidance on generative AI . If you use AI in your proces
 s\, please include this in your statement and briefly explain how and why 
 it was used. Submission steps & Prizes Step 1: Submit your self-portrait (
 and tell us about yourself) through this online form. Step 2: Watch for yo
 ur self-portrait to appear in the face2face Instagram Series . We can’t 
 wait to see your submission! The submission deadline is August 30\, 2026. 
 🎨 Two Runner-Up Prizes: Gift bags filled with awesome goodies\, courtes
 y of Above Ground Art Supplies ! 🏆 Grand Prize: A $125 gift card\, gene
 rously provided by Above Ground Art Supplies ! Please note: Prize winners 
 will be selected at random from all eligible submissions. Selection is not
  based on artistic quality\, process\, or style. Good luck! * Campus Life 
 and OCAD University reserve the right to use select submissions for promot
 ional purposes\, on OCAD U’s website and/or printed materials.
LOCATION:Online-Only
URL:https://forms.cloud.microsoft/r/RJ84piqe1u
X-SOURCE:OCAD University
END:VEVENT
